{"ref":"BDB, אָפִיק","hw":"אָפִיק","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָפִיק</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.16\">2 S 22:16</a></sup> <strong>channel (</strong>as holding, confining waters; poet.<strong>)</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפִיק</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:15\" href=\"/Job.6.15\">Jb 6:15</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפִיקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.3\">Ez 6:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפִקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.6\">Ez 32:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפִ(י)קֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.16\">2 S 22:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:20\" href=\"/Joel.1.20\">Jo 1:20</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפִיקֶיךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.8\">Ez 35:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲפִיקָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.7\">Is 8:7</a>—<em>channel</em> = <em>stream-bed, ravine</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 42:2\" href=\"/Psalms.42.2\">ψ 42:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Joel 1:20\" href=\"/Joel.1.20\">Jo 1:20</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Joel 4:18\" href=\"/Joel.4.18\">4:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:12\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.12\">Ct 5:12</a>; also <a data-ref=\"Psalms 18:16\" href=\"/Psalms.18.16\">ψ 18:16</a>, but better <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יָם</span> as <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 22:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.22.16\">2 S 22:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ נְחָלִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 6:15\" href=\"/Job.6.15\">Jb 6:15</a>; of river-bed <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.7\">Is 8:7</a>; so also (without defining word) <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:12\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.12\">Ez 31:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 32:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.32.6\">32:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 34:13\" href=\"/Ezekiel.34.13\">34:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 126:4\" href=\"/Psalms.126.4\">ψ 126:4</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּיְא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 6:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.6.3\">Ez 6:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 35:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.35.8\">35:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.4\">36:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:6\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.6\">6</a>; fig. of bones of hippopotamus (as hollow) <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ נְחֻשָׁה</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 40:18\" href=\"/Job.40.18\">Jb 40:18</a>; of furrows betw. scales of crocodile <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מָגִנִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 41:7\" href=\"/Job.41.7\">41:7</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">מְזִיחַ אֲפִיקִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 12:21\" href=\"/Job.12.21\">Jb 12:21</a> is dub.; Thes MV Di al. say <em>girdle of</em> the <em>strong</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">אָפִיק</span> = <em>firm, forceful</em>, or—Di—<em>capable, powerful</em>); ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">נְדִיבִים</span>. <a data-ref=\"Job 12:21\" href=\"/Job.12.21\">Jb 12:21</a> read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבִּירִים</span> Du (v. also Bu).","next":"BDB, אֲפֵק","prev":"BDB, אָפַק"}